1
00:00:00,183 --> 00:00:03,563
(Sheldon:)So I guess you're really
holding up the other four fingers?

2
00:00:07,056 --> 00:00:08,766
(Penny:)Oh, hey, what are you
doing here so early?

3
00:00:08,925 --> 00:00:11,565
(Amy:)-Driving Sheldon to work.
-He's still mad at Leonard, huh?

4
00:00:11,728 --> 00:00:13,108
(Amy:)He's mad at you, too.

5
00:00:13,263 --> 00:00:16,733
(Amy:)He says you're the succubus
who led his friend astray.

6
00:00:18,601 --> 00:00:21,671
(Stuart:)I don't know
what "succubus" is, but...

7
00:00:21,838 --> 00:00:24,048
It has "suck" in it,
so that can't be good.

8
00:00:26,376 --> 00:00:28,376
(Sheldon:)-Thought I heard you out here.
-Hey, Sheldon.

9
00:00:28,545 --> 00:00:31,715
You don't get a "hey."
You get a "hmm."

10
00:00:31,881 --> 00:00:33,621
(Penny:)Come on, don't be like that.

11
00:00:33,783 --> 00:00:36,063
(Penny:)We had so much fun together
the last couple uf months.

12
00:00:36,219 --> 00:00:39,129
(Sheldon:)You're right. Which makes your
betrayal all the more devastating.

13
00:00:39,289 --> 00:00:40,959
(Leonard:)-Sheldon...
-I let you buy

14
00:00:41,124 --> 00:00:44,124
(Sheldon:)feminine hygiene products
with my supermarket club card.

15
00:00:45,762 --> 00:00:49,112
(Sheldon:)You have any idea the kind of coupons
I'm going to get in the mail now?

16
00:00:50,466 --> 00:00:53,306
Sheldon, your Hght's with Leonard.
Penny's got nothing to do--

17
00:00:53,469 --> 00:00:54,949
(Sheldon:)Careful, Amy.

18
00:00:55,104 --> 00:00:58,814
(Sheldon:)The friend of my enemy's girlfriend
is my enemy.

